   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_aca80ff13375de69dd5d",
   "sourceHash": "aca80ff13375de69dd5d30cfa87668e1ee0b4608bf7b22055a4b0ee03f5285c5",
   "text": "Galeria de fotos",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4a9aabaa238a13b1318b",
   "sourceHash": "4a9aabaa238a13b1318b2e7a042edfc364e2c5db37eb210a75e7647faa8ac1b8",
   "text": "Um caminho para a paz: encontre a calma entre o encanto rústico e o esplendor da natureza.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_69f9dd51e18d6da9b8dd",
   "sourceHash": "69f9dd51e18d6da9b8ddea74ea5528c4bd3c2c12528b70489754f411d2ed2b83",
   "text": "Desfrute de uma sessão relaxante de terapia ayurvédica para revitalizar os sentidos.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_52ef6e5fc2a6dc20c865",
   "sourceHash": "52ef6e5fc2a6dc20c865be30387af4784d92080394d4110fde37a201801f52b1",
   "text": "O caminho para o bem-estar: passeie pelo Kairali, envolvido pela tranquilidade da natureza.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fab0560001f80acadc6a",
   "sourceHash": "fab0560001f80acadc6a6d05d7e476aa18d6ebe91c84bb755b807fbc032883db",
   "text": "Recuperação natural, revitalização e desintoxicação através do Ayurveda autêntico no Kairali.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'healing' rendered as 'recuperação' to avoid Portuguese 'cura' (banned 'cure')."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_78afa5613ca03578c980",
   "sourceHash": "78afa5613ca03578c980e8747d35f98de2ebd10f7451e04afc1dda7b4b07e5ec",
   "text": "Encontre a paz interior praticando yoga orientado no Kairali e experimente um bem-estar abrangente.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3fcd13b8f0f2fe47ebf2",
   "sourceHash": "3fcd13b8f0f2fe47ebf2e21f7382a0f7a14201fe17932bc814b233872d097206",
   "text": "Descontrair, recuperar, revitalizar: os tratamentos do Kairali integram o Ayurveda intemporal na sua busca de bem-estar.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Heal' rendered as 'recuperar' to avoid Portuguese 'curar' (banned 'cure')."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1890a6c3990e4dfa8644",
   "sourceHash": "1890a6c3990e4dfa8644c406ef20d79a9486a5e3fcb328832b00d0a1b2d02404",
   "text": "Uma riqueza cultural: visite o Kairali para conhecer os costumes ancestrais de Kerala.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_98f34e16f287ac227022",
   "sourceHash": "98f34e16f287ac2270229684ec6db7c31b39efe8d9a648ae0ba753d330358989",
   "text": "Um sabor de bem-estar: saboreie pratos ayurvédicos tradicionais no Kairali.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6b362e27dd7148e931cf",
   "sourceHash": "6b362e27dd7148e931cf33bd72de24f4dabaca368b2625a43b38e0804314f28d",
   "text": "Relaxe os sentidos com a terapia Shirodhara do Kairali, para o máximo equilíbrio e relaxamento.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a1471a472c4e5ec5ee43",
   "sourceHash": "a1471a472c4e5ec5ee432655ee3593c9e3395446df1977388b23bca5e574b995",
   "text": "Descubra o seu equilíbrio interior no ambiente tranquilo do Kairali, um santuário da natureza.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_95f9063a2fa238165489",
   "sourceHash": "95f9063a2fa238165489be52592b06188b04b76072346cff1c7f278cc59712d2",
   "text": "O yoga no sereno esplendor da vegetação exuberante do Kairali pode ajudá-lo a encontrar o seu equilíbrio zen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f209b22814b0bafe9f46",
   "sourceHash": "f209b22814b0bafe9f46560a2df1831b936948ef40cea38c65393e52e813fa5a",
   "text": "Uma mulher de blusa vermelha e xaile dourado junto a um corrimão de madeira, entre coqueiros",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d975c6345d0451d8c675",
   "sourceHash": "d975c6345d0451d8c675600c2d17fbab1320cd4a660d0ecc995be9e449da9543",
